
# hey, welcome to the example modlist
# as you can see, if you lead a line with a #, RMM skips it.
# this lets you comment out problem mods from your pack!
# comments will NOT be included in an export, only in a handmade file (modnames will be appended in exports)
# comments can be included after an RMM-ID. Just make sure to pad it out.
# use this to build up your first modpack (or just steal mine :3)
# (yes, I play with a LOT of mods. i kinda had to make this lol)

# THIS MODPACK IS NOT COMPLETE. EXPECT PROBLEMS IN-GAME.

# this modpack is MASSIVE. Expect an extracted download size in excess of 20 GB.

# "essential" mods
railroader-1645$fuse!toolshed   # fuse
railroader-1645$toolshed   # toolshed
railroader-1618  # ZRVF - Visual Framework
railroader-285   # TheTies - Doubles the rendering limit for ties and tie plates.
railroader-569   # dynamic weather
railroader-1029  # Waypoint Queue
railroader-434   # SCOLD
railroader-1401  # RTM Avatar Enhancer (AE)
